\f0\fs32 \cf0 Welcome to the Bookish alpha release.\
\
A small disclaimer, so that you know what you're letting yourself in for:\
\
This is an early release, and is in an unfinished state. The user interface in particular is distinctly unpolished. Watch out for splinters...\
\
You will probably encounter bugs, and you will most certainly encounter things that don't seem untuitive. You'll probably feel that there are essential features missing. You may have to use your imagination at times! \
\
All this is to be expected right now, but I am interested in hearing about it. Please do let me know what doesn't work for you, or what you think I need to change or add. It might be on my list already, but it might not.\
\
At this stage 
\f1\b I cannot guarantee that your data is safe
\f0\b0 . Please don't spend days entering your entire collection! I do have some safety features in place though to try to prevent data loss, though, so do let me know if something bad happens!\
